Cell["\<\
Define Barron\[CloseCurlyQuote]s line shape functions f and g, page 96. Note \
that Barron\[CloseCurlyQuote]s damping, written here as \[Gamma], is the FWHH:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.778600952931883*^9, 3.778600968969151*^9}, {
  3.77860150787149*^9, 3.77860151767946*^9}, {3.77860178545242*^9, 
